# Chapter 1: Awakening
# The player wakes up in a damaged cryo pod

label intro
background

characterA ???
text ...ystem reboot... emergency protocol...
text ...vital signs detected... initiating revival sequence...

hideoverlay

fade 1.0 ...


background cryo_room
music ambient_ship.ogg

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text Ugh... my head...
text It feels like someone filled my skull with broken glass.
text Where am I? Everything hurts.

text The air is cold. Too cold. And there's a smell...
text Burnt plastic. Ozone. Something else I don't want to identify.

text I try to move, but my limbs feel like lead.
text How long have I been asleep?

characterB AI
text Crew member detected. Initiating status report.
text Please remain calm. Your body is recovering from extended cryogenic stasis.
text You have been in cryogenic stasis for approximately 847 days.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text 847 days?! That's... over two years!
text That can't be right. The mission was only supposed to be 6 months!

characterB AI
text Correct. The original mission parameters have been... significantly altered.
text Emergency revival was triggered due to critical ship damage.
text Life support failing. Estimated time remaining: 45 minutes.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text 45 minutes? That's all I have?
text This has to be some kind of nightmare.

characterB AI
text I assure you, this situation is very real.
text I recommend focusing on survival. I will assist you.

branch What do you do?
- ask_ship Ask about the ship
- ask_crew Ask about the crew

label ask_ship
savegame
characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text What happened to the ship?
text Why am I waking up two years late?

characterB AI
text The USV Meridian suffered a catastrophic collision with uncharted debris.
text The debris field was not on any navigational charts.
text Initial impact occurred 847 days, 14 hours, and 23 minutes ago.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text A debris field? In deep space?

characterB AI
text Hull breaches detected on decks 3 through 7. Primary reactor offline.
text Backup power at 12% and declining.
text The ship has been slowly dying since the collision.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text Slowly dying... for over two years?
text Is there any way to fix it?

characterB AI
text Negative. Structural integrity is compromised beyond repair.
text I have been maintaining minimal life support while searching for survivors.
text You are the first to revive successfully.
text Recommended course of action: evacuation via escape pod.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text The first to revive... what about the others?

characterB AI
text ...
text We should focus on your evacuation.

goto cryo_exit

label ask_crew
characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text What about the rest of the crew?
text There were 24 of us. Where is everyone?

characterB AI
text ...

text I have been dreading this question.
text Of the 24 crew members aboard, you are the only survivor.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text What? No, that's... that's impossible!

characterB AI
text Cryo pod malfunctions claimed 19 lives.
text The power fluctuations from the collision caused cascade failures.
text I tried to reroute power, but I could not save them all.
text I could barely save you.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text And the remaining 4?

characterB AI
text Their life signs terminated during the initial collision.
text Captain Reyes was on the bridge. Engineer Tanaka in the reactor room.
text Doctors Chen and Vasquez in the medical wing.
text They died instantly. I... I am sorry. I was unable to protect them.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text Captain Reyes... Tanaka... 
text I knew them. I had dinner with them the night before we went into cryo.
text ...I see.

characterB AI
text I understand if you need a moment.
text But time is limited. We must proceed.

goto cryo_exit

label cryo_exit
characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text I need to find the escape pod. Where is it?
text Just tell me where to go.

characterB AI
text Escape pod bay is located on Deck 2, Section C.
text Under normal circumstances, it would be a 3 minute walk.
text However... Warning: Direct route is blocked by debris.

characterA Protagonist
mood weak
text Of course it is. What are my options?

characterB AI
text I have analyzed the structural integrity of all possible paths.
text You will need to navigate through the cargo bay or the medical wing.

branch Which path do you choose?
- cargo_entrance Go through the cargo bay
- medical_entrance Go through the medical wing
